   "id": 337519,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "You are considering four possible options for your new savings account. You plan to deposit $13,000 and leave this amount in the account for 20 years with no additional deposits or withdrawals. All of these account options would earn 6% interest, but each one has a different compounding frequency, listed below. What would be the value of each account at the end of the 20-year period?\n<ol type=\"a\">\n<li>Annually</li>\n<li>Semiannually</li>\n<li>Quarterly</li>\n<li>Monthly</li>\n</ol>\n",
